flakewm is the Wayland compositor of the GXDE desktop, based on
kylin-wlcom and wlroots. It implements the common wlroots, KDE and UKUI
protocols as well as the Hyprland private protocols (global shortcuts,
toplevel export, input capture, focus grab and others), so desktop
shells and tools written for those compositors work with it.

The package contains the compositor and its client library
(libflakewm-client). The GXDE session launcher is Linux only.
